{"time": 1753547847, "type": "recv", "message_id": "418607250", "deleted": false, "dect": {"host_id": null, "group_id": "121735290", "user_id": "2388921818"}, "sender": {"id": "2388921818", "name": "我叫五个五"}, "message": "（OK）"}
{"time": 1753548021, "type": "recv", "message_id": "1922570188", "deleted": false, "dect": {"host_id": null, "group_id": "121735290", "user_id": "2388921818"}, "sender": {"id": "2388921818", "name": "我叫五个五"}, "message": "在某个夏天的黄昏，也就是日本民俗传说所谓的逢魔之时，某个少女躲过学校保安，背起书包准备前往旧校舍。"}
{"time": 1753548115, "type": "recv", "message_id": "1498680167", "deleted": false, "dect": {"host_id": null, "group_id": "121735290", "user_id": "1252219916"}, "sender": {"id": "1252219916", "name": "千成之愿"}, "message": "整理一下匆匆赶路时弄乱的衣服，手里捏着御守，包里装着御币和御盐，\"虽然...不太信这东西，但是带着好像也没什么问题。\""}
{"time": 1753548162, "type": "recv", "message_id": "1959338098", "deleted": false, "dect": {"host_id": null, "group_id": "121735290", "user_id": "2388921818"}, "sender": {"id": "2388921818", "name": "我叫五个五"}, "message": "而这个少女为何要冒着风险前往学校的旧校舍呢？是因为前两天的学校流传了一起幽灵的流言，作为对侦探小说和灵异故事感兴趣的一名学生，兼将来要继承自家神社的巫女，她确实在昨天黄昏的逢魔之时看到了意思幽灵的白色影子在旧校舍的山路上一闪而过"}
{"time": 1753548246, "type": "recv", "message_id": "1032018800", "deleted": false, "dect": {"host_id": null, "group_id": "121735290", "user_id": "2388921818"}, "sender": {"id": "2388921818", "name": "我叫五个五"}, "message": "少女所上的学校是坐落于山中的一个小县城，而这所学校的历史能追随到上个世纪60年代"}
{"time": 1753548265, "type": "recv", "message_id": "1749673234", "deleted": false, "dect": {"host_id": null, "group_id": "121735290", "user_id": "2388921818"}, "sender": {"id": "2388921818", "name": "我叫五个五"}, "message": "少女的妈妈也曾经在此学校念书。"}
{"time": 1753548303, "type": "recv", "message_id": "422565457", "deleted": false, "dect": {"host_id": null, "group_id": "121735290", "user_id": "2388921818"}, "sender": {"id": "2388921818", "name": "我叫五个五"}, "message": "前往旧校舍的山路无人搭理，石台阶上遍布青苔和杂草。"}
{"time": 1753548331, "type": "recv", "message_id": "714636522", "deleted": false, "dect": {"host_id": null, "group_id": "121735290", "user_id": "2388921818"}, "sender": {"id": "2388921818", "name": "我叫五个五"}, "message": "在小路中段，立着铁栅栏和警示牌。"}
{"time": 1753548347, "type": "recv", "message_id": "2100314740", "deleted": false, "dect": {"host_id": null, "group_id": "121735290", "user_id": "1252219916"}, "sender": {"id": "1252219916", "name": "千成之愿"}, "message": "\"唔...绝对不是我自己好奇才过来的。\"踢开路上的石子，一路走"}
{"time": 1753548354, "type": "recv", "message_id": "1769094360", "deleted": false, "dect": {"host_id": null, "group_id": "121735290", "user_id": "2388921818"}, "sender": {"id": "2388921818", "name": "我叫五个五"}, "message": "显示着“警告，年久失修，禁止进入”字样"}
{"time": 1753548424, "type": "recv", "message_id": "369767013", "deleted": false, "dect": {"host_id": null, "group_id": "121735290", "user_id": "1252219916"}, "sender": {"id": "1252219916", "name": "千成之愿"}, "message": "伸手看看能不能拉开"}
{"time": 1753548434, "type": "recv", "message_id": "1630248893", "deleted": false, "dect": {"host_id": null, "group_id": "121735290", "user_id": "1252219916"}, "sender": {"id": "1252219916", "name": "千成之愿"}, "message": "透过栅栏看看路的另一边"}
{"time": 1753548499, "type": "recv", "message_id": "1274059642", "deleted": false, "dect": {"host_id": null, "group_id": "121735290", "user_id": "2388921818"}, "sender": {"id": "2388921818", "name": "我叫五个五"}, "message": "路的另一边是一片树林，再往上望去即是修在一座小山包上的旧校舍。"}
{"time": 1753548507, "type": "recv", "message_id": "1182351290", "deleted": false, "dect": {"host_id": null, "group_id": "121735290", "user_id": "2388921818"}, "sender": {"id": "2388921818", "name": "我叫五个五"}, "message": "（可以过个侦查）"}
{"time": 1753548557, "type": "recv", "message_id": "958338460", "deleted": false, "dect": {"host_id": null, "group_id": "121735290", "user_id": "1252219916"}, "sender": {"id": "1252219916", "name": "千成之愿"}, "message": "。ra侦查"}
{"time": 1753548557, "type": "reply", "message_id": "958338460", "deleted": false, "dect": {"host_id": null, "group_id": "121735290", "user_id": "1252219916"}, "sender": {"id": 2875548981, "name": "小雅"}, "message": "[浅上绘梨花]进行技能[侦查:80]检定: 1D100=21 困难成功，且将新火试新茶，诗酒趁年华"}
{"time": 1753548594, "type": "recv", "message_id": "1300339023", "deleted": false, "dect": {"host_id": null, "group_id": "121735290", "user_id": "2388921818"}, "sender": {"id": "2388921818", "name": "我叫五个五"}, "message": "铁栅栏并不能拉开，但是似乎两块栅栏拼合部分的缝隙刚好能够让少女纤瘦的身体钻过去。"}
{"time": 1753548617, "type": "recv", "message_id": "939834711", "deleted": false, "dect": {"host_id": null, "group_id": "121735290", "user_id": "1252219916"}, "sender": {"id": "1252219916", "name": "千成之愿"}, "message": "\"妈妈以前在这个校舍住过吗？\"回想起来发现忘记问这件事了，甩甩头发，把包取下来先放过去，自己再从缝隙挤进去"}
{"time": 1753548740, "type": "recv", "message_id": "958554131", "deleted": false, "dect": {"host_id": null, "group_id": "121735290", "user_id": "2388921818"}, "sender": {"id": "2388921818", "name": "我叫五个五"}, "message": "在少女向旧校舍望去时，地平线上橘红色太阳正好被被一片云挡住，让旧校舍蒙上了一层阴影，很奇怪的是，少女发现即使有阴影，但是似乎校舍内某扇窗户似乎仍有反光。"}
{"time": 1753548853, "type": "recv", "message_id": "64467516", "deleted": false, "dect": {"host_id": null, "group_id": "121735290", "user_id": "1252219916"}, "sender": {"id": "1252219916", "name": "千成之愿"}, "message": "\"里面有人吗？\"挤进栅栏，背上包小跑过去"}
{"time": 1753548917, "type": "recv", "message_id": "1708212101", "deleted": false, "dect": {"host_id": null, "group_id": "121735290", "user_id": "2388921818"}, "sender": {"id": "2388921818", "name": "我叫五个五"}, "message": "少女进入剩下一半的小路，这段比之前更加难走，有的石砖似乎是被大雨冲刷得歪歪斜斜。"}
{"time": 1753548968, "type": "recv", "message_id": "2133333800", "deleted": false, "dect": {"host_id": null, "group_id": "121735290", "user_id": "2388921818"}, "sender": {"id": "2388921818", "name": "我叫五个五"}, "message": "（你可以过灵感）"}
