{"time": 1753551996, "type": "recv", "message_id": "1017807094", "deleted": false, "dect": {"host_id": null, "group_id": "121735290", "user_id": "2388921818"}, "sender": {"id": "2388921818", "name": "我叫五个五"}, "message": "因为没有人居住，这旧校舍似乎连老鼠蟑螂什么的都消失了。"}
