{"time": 1753557842, "type": "recv", "message_id": "302458108", "deleted": false, "dect": {"host_id": null, "group_id": "121735290", "user_id": "1252219916"}, "sender": {"id": "1252219916", "name": "千成之愿"}, "message": "(难道我要抓回去)"}
{"time": 1753557868, "type": "recv", "message_id": "137309276", "deleted": false, "dect": {"host_id": null, "group_id": "121735290", "user_id": "1252219916"}, "sender": {"id": "1252219916", "name": "千成之愿"}, "message": "虽然最后一个问题的答案是否。。但是依然决心要回到镜子前对峙"}
{"time": 1753557973, "type": "recv", "message_id": "725688565", "deleted": false, "dect": {"host_id": null, "group_id": "121735290", "user_id": "2388921818"}, "sender": {"id": "2388921818", "name": "我叫五个五"}, "message": "你回到四楼，发现不仅布局反过来了，宿舍的门牌号也都变成相反的了，如同被镜中的景象一样"}
{"time": 1753558058, "type": "recv", "message_id": "27868692", "deleted": false, "dect": {"host_id": null, "group_id": "121735290", "user_id": "2388921818"}, "sender": {"id": "2388921818", "name": "我叫五个五"}, "message": "进入之前本应该是401的宿舍，回到镜子面前。"}
{"time": 1753558078, "type": "recv", "message_id": "1399052679", "deleted": false, "dect": {"host_id": null, "group_id": "121735290", "user_id": "2388921818"}, "sender": {"id": "2388921818", "name": "我叫五个五"}, "message": "镜子里仍然映射不出你的身影。"}
{"time": 1753558104, "type": "recv", "message_id": "828548464", "deleted": false, "dect": {"host_id": null, "group_id": "121735290", "user_id": "2388921818"}, "sender": {"id": "2388921818", "name": "我叫五个五"}, "message": "不久后，那个“自己”犹如鬼魅般的出现在门口，悄无声息。"}
{"time": 1753558118, "type": "recv", "message_id": "1002941396", "deleted": false, "dect": {"host_id": null, "group_id": "121735290", "user_id": "1252219916"}, "sender": {"id": "1252219916", "name": "千成之愿"}, "message": "皱着眉看她"}
{"time": 1753558127, "type": "recv", "message_id": "1766164505", "deleted": false, "dect": {"host_id": null, "group_id": "121735290", "user_id": "2388921818"}, "sender": {"id": "2388921818", "name": "我叫五个五"}, "message": "“这么难得的机会，果然还是不能放弃呢。”"}
{"time": 1753558128, "type": "recv", "message_id": "1170454732", "deleted": false, "dect": {"host_id": null, "group_id": "121735290", "user_id": "1252219916"}, "sender": {"id": "1252219916", "name": "千成之愿"}, "message": "\"你就是幽灵吧\""}
{"time": 1753558134, "type": "recv", "message_id": "1253982357", "deleted": false, "dect": {"host_id": null, "group_id": "121735290", "user_id": "2388921818"}, "sender": {"id": "2388921818", "name": "我叫五个五"}, "message": "她又恢复了微笑。"}
{"time": 1753558149, "type": "recv", "message_id": "248281772", "deleted": false, "dect": {"host_id": null, "group_id": "121735290", "user_id": "2388921818"}, "sender": {"id": "2388921818", "name": "我叫五个五"}, "message": "“我就是你啊。”"}
{"time": 1753558163, "type": "recv", "message_id": "837901625", "deleted": false, "dect": {"host_id": null, "group_id": "121735290", "user_id": "1252219916"}, "sender": {"id": "1252219916", "name": "千成之愿"}, "message": "站在原地等她"}
{"time": 1753558186, "type": "recv", "message_id": "214714720", "deleted": false, "dect": {"host_id": null, "group_id": "121735290", "user_id": "1252219916"}, "sender": {"id": "1252219916", "name": "千成之愿"}, "message": "\"你要和我交换?不怕我妈妈吗？\""}
{"time": 1753558191, "type": "recv", "message_id": "344842097", "deleted": false, "dect": {"host_id": null, "group_id": "121735290", "user_id": "2388921818"}, "sender": {"id": "2388921818", "name": "我叫五个五"}, "message": "随后，她突然出现一抓打在御守的光壁上。"}
{"time": 1753558208, "type": "recv", "message_id": "1142141924", "deleted": false, "dect": {"host_id": null, "group_id": "121735290", "user_id": "2388921818"}, "sender": {"id": "2388921818", "name": "我叫五个五"}, "message": "“这种事，出去了再说。”"}
{"time": 1753558215, "type": "recv", "message_id": "1897392578", "deleted": false, "dect": {"host_id": null, "group_id": "121735290", "user_id": "2388921818"}, "sender": {"id": "2388921818", "name": "我叫五个五"}, "message": "（可以过侦查）"}
