{"time": 1753558367, "type": "recv", "message_id": "1883061799", "deleted": false, "dect": {"host_id": null, "group_id": "121735290", "user_id": "2388921818"}, "sender": {"id": "2388921818", "name": "我叫五个五"}, "message": "在被突然袭击了好几次之后，你已经有了经验，不像以往一样慌乱，这时你发现镜子中有了一道身影，不过是对面的那个“自己”。"}
{"time": 1753558390, "type": "recv", "message_id": "991353183", "deleted": false, "dect": {"host_id": null, "group_id": "121735290", "user_id": "2388921818"}, "sender": {"id": "2388921818", "name": "我叫五个五"}, "message": "（感觉可以结束了）"}
{"time": 1753558411, "type": "recv", "message_id": "543548237", "deleted": false, "dect": {"host_id": null, "group_id": "121735290", "user_id": "1252219916"}, "sender": {"id": "1252219916", "name": "千成之愿"}, "message": "瞅准机会，对着镜子里的自己伸出手抓住她的手腕"}
{"time": 1753558425, "type": "recv", "message_id": "1206696118", "deleted": false, "dect": {"host_id": null, "group_id": "121735290", "user_id": "2388921818"}, "sender": {"id": "2388921818", "name": "我叫五个五"}, "message": "“什么！”"}
{"time": 1753558439, "type": "recv", "message_id": "1181542196", "deleted": false, "dect": {"host_id": null, "group_id": "121735290", "user_id": "1252219916"}, "sender": {"id": "1252219916", "name": "千成之愿"}, "message": "\"出去不出去...不是你说了算！\""}
{"time": 1753558468, "type": "recv", "message_id": "2047636316", "deleted": false, "dect": {"host_id": null, "group_id": "121735290", "user_id": "2388921818"}, "sender": {"id": "2388921818", "name": "我叫五个五"}, "message": "随着你用力一拉。"}
{"time": 1753558492, "type": "recv", "message_id": "93023968", "deleted": false, "dect": {"host_id": null, "group_id": "121735290", "user_id": "2388921818"}, "sender": {"id": "2388921818", "name": "我叫五个五"}, "message": "你跌坐在墙上，看着镜子中那个错愕的“自己”。"}
{"time": 1753558525, "type": "recv", "message_id": "844856254", "deleted": false, "dect": {"host_id": null, "group_id": "121735290", "user_id": "2388921818"}, "sender": {"id": "2388921818", "name": "我叫五个五"}, "message": "侧身望去，宿舍房间内的布局已经回归到最初的样子。"}
{"time": 1753558543, "type": "recv", "message_id": "543449686", "deleted": false, "dect": {"host_id": null, "group_id": "121735290", "user_id": "1252219916"}, "sender": {"id": "1252219916", "name": "千成之愿"}, "message": "立刻从镜子前退开，\"回来了...\""}
{"time": 1753558584, "type": "recv", "message_id": "1237127373", "deleted": false, "dect": {"host_id": null, "group_id": "121735290", "user_id": "1252219916"}, "sender": {"id": "1252219916", "name": "千成之愿"}, "message": "\"我不会给你机会了。\"转身就跑下楼，从后门跑下山回家"}
{"time": 1753558613, "type": "recv", "message_id": "1394297916", "deleted": false, "dect": {"host_id": null, "group_id": "121735290", "user_id": "1252219916"}, "sender": {"id": "1252219916", "name": "千成之愿"}, "message": "手里捏着御守喘气"}
{"time": 1753558647, "type": "recv", "message_id": "455297095", "deleted": false, "dect": {"host_id": null, "group_id": "121735290", "user_id": "2388921818"}, "sender": {"id": "2388921818", "name": "我叫五个五"}, "message": "没有时间害怕了，少女直接用平生最快的速度跑出宿舍楼下山。"}
{"time": 1753558668, "type": "recv", "message_id": "73342845", "deleted": false, "dect": {"host_id": null, "group_id": "121735290", "user_id": "2388921818"}, "sender": {"id": "2388921818", "name": "我叫五个五"}, "message": "而那处警告栏杆，没有任何东西能阻挡少女。"}
{"time": 1753558717, "type": "recv", "message_id": "298013038", "deleted": false, "dect": {"host_id": null, "group_id": "121735290", "user_id": "2388921818"}, "sender": {"id": "2388921818", "name": "我叫五个五"}, "message": "避开巡逻的保安离开学校大门，回到家。"}
{"time": 1753558757, "type": "recv", "message_id": "671092456", "deleted": false, "dect": {"host_id": null, "group_id": "121735290", "user_id": "2388921818"}, "sender": {"id": "2388921818", "name": "我叫五个五"}, "message": "少女因为体力透支加上心力憔悴，立刻就在床上睡去。"}
